&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;Channel Sales Support Agent About the role The Channel Sales Support Agent is the operational backbone for our independent contractor (IC) sales teams in the field. You&#39;ll be their go-to person—making sure they have everything they need to successfully sell and onboard our products to local sellers across Europe. This isn&#39;t just a support role. You&#39;re enabling entrepreneurs to build their businesses, and their success is your success. Who you are You&#39;re someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
