&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;Why this role matters Our independent contractors are out there every day, building relationships and helping local businesses grow. You&#39;re the person who makes sure they&#39;re never stuck, never without answers, and always set up to succeed. If you love being the reliable force behind a winning team, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
