&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Block builds simple, powerful tools that make progress towards an economy that’s truly open to all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people. Square makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers. Cash App is the easy way to spend, send, and store money. Afterpay is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time. TIDAL is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs. Bitkey is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin. Proto is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone. Join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square serves millions of sellers, and every one of them begins their relationship with us through a trust decision. Trust is foundational to Square: we protect sellers and the business from bad actors while enabling companies of all sizes to grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Product Lead, Trust, you&#39;ll set the Square-wide strategy for building and maintaining seller trust, managing the roadmap across Risk and Identity. You&#39;ll navigate the space&#39;s central tensions — access vs. protection, growth vs. fraud prevention — and be accountable for Risk Loss Rate, Seller Trust, and ecosystem health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role: you&#39;ll own the most ambiguous, highest-stakes Trust bets as a hands-on DRI while coaching a small group of senior PMs — developing their craft and judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a Square-wide perspective on Trust for strategic planning, ensuring trust considerations are embedded across all seller-facing products and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the product organization across multiple product areas including Identity Verification, Access, Disputes, and Controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as hands-on DRI on the hardest Trust problems, setting the gold standard for craft, while coaching senior PMs to raise their capability and taste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the seller experience: make verification, limits, and remediation fair and fast for legitimate sellers, and fix blind spots that falsely decline good businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accountability for Risk Loss Rate, Seller Trust metrics, Access expansion for trusted sellers, and ecosystem health across all of Square&#39;s products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate AI-native: set the vision for how AI reshapes Trust products and the team&#39;s own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage regulators, compliance bodies, and identity-verification partners, shaping the regulatory landscape into Product and GTM strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution across multiple functions and organizations including Product, Engineering, Compliance, Legal, and Operations to deliver on Trust and Safety initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management, including several leading and coaching senior product talent in complex or regulated domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven player-coach orientation. You ship your own work at senior scope while leveling up other PMs as people, not managing their tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of originating strategy in ambiguous space and building platform/infrastructure products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional narrative skills. You align executives, regulators, and teams around a trust strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with trust &amp;amp; safety, risk, identity, or compliance products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing regulatory requirements and compliance-driven product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payments or fintech products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fraud prevention, identity verification, or KYC/AML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record with both internal tooling and customer-facing product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ML/AI-powered risk and fraud detection systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity verification providers (Veriff, Onfido, Persona, Jumio)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of global regulatory frameworks (FATF, AMLD, GDPR, CFPB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
