&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Account Management, Sales, Business Development, or Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of direct people management experience in a quota-carrying or performance-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of consistently exceeding revenue and retention goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SMB or Mid-Market businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
