&lt;li&gt;Experience in business analysis, strategy, management consulting, financial services, or a quantitative analytical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in SQL and advanced quantitative modeling techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize complex quantitative findings into clear, actionable recommendations for cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI tools, with a genuine interest in staying current as the tools evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Economics, Finance, Engineering, Data Science, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
