&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead full month-end close and consolidation process of global accounting function, ensure the accuracy of the financial statements in compliance with US GAAP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee multiple key corporate accounting functions including opex accrual, prepaids, payroll accounting, and intercompany transactions etc; build top center of excellence team to support global controllership functions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support certain product accounting as needed, collaborate with the technical accounting team on new product launches and translate it into operational procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate existing processes to identify opportunities to optimize the process and decrease time to close.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive tasks and lead the team to build scalable solutions including leveraging AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead significant ERP and system implementations as financial systems DRI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all close deliverables are audit-ready and coordinate with auditors and service providers to support smooth financial statements audits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong cross functional relationships within the organization and proactively take the lead to support changes within the fast growing business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all key internal controls over operations and financial reporting are in place and operating in accordance with Sarbanes-Oxley rules and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and scale a high-performing team to support the growth and development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
