&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a full-time, degree-seeking program (Bachelor&#39;s or equivalent) with an expected graduation date between Winter 2027 and Spring 2028.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in college-level consulting, strategy projects, or non-traditional analytical work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven self-starter mindset with the ability to take full ownership of projects and drive results independently with minimal instruction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in financial services, brokerage platforms, and the APAC fintech landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to comfortably navigate ambiguous or incomplete information and synthesize it into clear strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the confidence to present high-impact insights directly to regional executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coursework or prior exposure to market research, business strategy, finance, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
