&lt;li&gt;Build and use AI agents and sub-agents to automate and scale privacy operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the selection and deployment of privacy-enhancing technologies (PETs), ensuring alignment with our technical architecture and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise stakeholders and adjust practices to maintain compliance in alignment with development in global privacy regulations, standards, and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal efforts to share best practices and increase awareness of privacy principles across engineering and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
