&lt;li&gt;You bring 2+ years of experience in data privacy, security, or privacy engineering, including hands-on work with privacy architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re highly proficient with AI, with hands-on experience building and utilizing agents and sub-agents to solve real operational or technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve managed both technical and operational processes at the same time, and know how to prioritize when things move fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re familiar with regulatory frameworks like GLBA, GDPR and CCPA and understand how to apply them to technical systems&lt;/li&gt;
