&lt;li&gt;Automate evidence-gathering processes for Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) and internal/external regulatory audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support enterprise vulnerability management programs and maintain operational resilience and uptime across core systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle evolving enterprise security challenges, such as protecting against active persistent threats (APTs) and securing the digital footprint of our executives.&lt;/li&gt;
