&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior PM on this team, you&#39;ll own end-to-end product experiences in new geographies and help set the playbook for every market that follows. Additionally, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
