&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1994&quot;&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA or New York, NY office(s), with in-person attendance expected at least &lt;strong&gt;3 days per week&lt;/strong&gt;. At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
