&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead a team of engineers, designers, researchers, data scientists, marketers, and cross-functional partners to better understand customers, government stakeholders, and the most pressing barriers to financial access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set the quality bar — the copy, flows, edge cases, and launch readiness that make complex financial and government workflows feel simple and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
