&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect our Autonomic Security Operations (ASO) roadmap, integrating AI agents and automated issue discovery to transform response capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code &amp;amp; Architecture Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Read and reason through complex, multi-language codebases to identify security vulnerabilities, evaluate threat vectors, and guide remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
