&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the long-term technical strategy and roadmap for core developer infrastructure, including CI, SCM, and development environments, ensuring systems scale reliably as engineering teams grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain robust, scalable infrastructure capable of handling increasing operational loads with a relentless focus on speed, safety, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the strategy for developer onboarding and remote development environments, reducing time-to-first-commit and making it effortless for engineers to be productive from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to standardize build and CI patterns, eliminate developer friction, and champion high engineering standards across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical mentorship to engineers across the team, conducting rigorous design reviews and establishing best-practice operational guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
