&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern build systems such as Bazel and distributed or remote build execution, with a strong understanding of CI/CD at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming proficiency in Go or Python, with a track record of building reliable, maintainable system software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to guide complex technical initiatives from conception to completion, aligning technical execution with company-wide objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to advocate for build and CI tooling adoption, drive onboarding improvements, and mentor other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
