&lt;li&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;documentation and manage remote contractors to complete datacenter installations and&amp;nbsp;upgrades, including hardware manufacturers, datacenter and network providers, logistics&amp;nbsp;partners and other service providers in support of our 120 and growing datacenter&amp;nbsp;location&lt;/li&gt;
