&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Business Operations, Consulting, Program Management, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project and program management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise SaaS experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Sales or Go-to-Market organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with strategic planning and executive operating rhythms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI and automation to improve productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
