&lt;p&gt;You are someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings clarity and structure to complex work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds strong relationships across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is organized and detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable managing multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
