&gt;&lt;li&gt;AI copilots that summarize context and suggest next actions for human review.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data reconciliation systems and exception queues for cross-system accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Observable audit pipelines for explainable decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom interview automation and internal technical assessment tooling.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design and operate AI-assisted workflows using the full Cloudflare stack.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate People systems via secure API, OAuth, and webhook patterns.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with HR, IT, Legal, and Security to translate operational pain into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement robust authorization, audit logging, and error handling for high-trust data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering background (TypeScript, Python, or Go) building internal tools or platform services.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with LLMs, RAG, tool calling, and prompt evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expertise in system-to-system integrations, identity, and event-driven workflows.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exceptional judgment regarding privacy, data minimization, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in internal platform engineering or compliance-heavy environments.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with React, Drizzle, Zod, and Postgres.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/h3&gt;
