&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, understanding complex customer use cases (node security, dApp delivery) and communicating compelling technical value propositions to C-level executives and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Build a robust pipeline, manage complex contract negotiations, and accurately forecast commercial outcomes with a disciplined approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Effectively scale the territory through collaboration with regional service providers and consulting partners.&lt;/li&gt;
