&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Manager, Premium &amp;amp; Wealth CX, you&#39;ll lead the team responsible for delivering white-glove support to Coinbase&#39;s highest-value customers, including High Net Worth, Ultra High Net Worth, and VIP segments across our International markets. The Premium &amp;amp; Wealth pillar within Customer Experience is the dedicated home for relationship-led, high-touch service that keeps our most sophisticated customers confident and supported. You&#39;ll own day-to-day operations, people leadership, and service quality for your vertical, partnering closely with Compliance, Risk, and cross-functional teams to scale a support model that is fast, accurate, risk-aware, and trusted within a non-advisory framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own operational performance for your vertical, including SLA attainment, CSAT, QA scores, backlog health, repeat contacts, and complaint rates, using data and trend analysis to drive measurable improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Specialists, setting clear expectations through regular 1:1s, performance reviews, and building a pipeline of future leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a high-touch support model centered on trusted 1:1 customer relationships, deep specialist knowledge, and end-to-end case ownership that minimizes handoffs for complex trading, account, and funding issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Compliance, Legal, Risk, Complaints, and Workforce Management to ensure workflows, escalations, and coverage models meet regulatory expectations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute real-time staffing, routing, and escalation decisions during market events, incidents, or volume spikes to protect customer outcomes across channels and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build process improvements by converting customer feedback, defects, and root causes into SOP, tooling, and policy changes in partnership with Product, Analytics, QA, and Learning and Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in financial services, fintech, wealth management, premium banking, or trading operations, with direct experience servicing HNW, UHNW, or VIP customer segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of people leadership in an operations or support environment, with a proven track record of managing senior specialists or team leads and improving performance across service quality, efficiency, and customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated familiarity with financial markets and trading products, including derivatives, and a clear understanding of the distinction between support and advice in a regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a regulated financial services environment and partnering with Compliance, Legal, Risk, and Complaints functions, with the ability to navigate jurisdiction-specific servicing, escalation, and complaints-handling expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds, or is willing and able to obtain within a defined timeframe, an appropriate UK wealth or securities qualification recognized by the FCA (e.g., CISI Level 4 Investment Advice Diploma or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
