&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Derivatives Sales Manager, UAE on the STP Derivative Sales team, you&#39;ll own Coinbase&#39;s derivatives growth across the UAE, MENA and Europe regions by building and scaling relationships with Professional Traders. This team drives revenue and market share for Coinbase Advanced&#39;s derivatives products across global markets covering Crypto Perps, Options and RWA products. You&#39;ll define and execute the regional sales strategy, lead market-entry efforts, and serve as Coinbase&#39;s senior market ambassador across one of crypto&#39;s fastest-growing regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a network of professional traders in the UAE, MENA and Europe driving revenue through high-touch, relationship-led acquisition from origination through onboarding and ongoing account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute the long-term sales strategy for the UAE, MENA and Europe regions, setting targets for market penetration, volume growth, and client expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional market-entry and expansion efforts, including navigating local regulatory landscapes and adapting Coinbase&#39;s derivatives offerings to meet regional compliance requirements and market demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Risk, and Compliance teams to localize perpetual futures, futures, and options products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Coinbase at client meetings, industry events, and conferences across the region, deepening relationships with existing clients and sourcing new high-value opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize sales processes, CRM workflows, and support structures to scale the Prosumer Derivatives business in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in derivatives sales, trading, or structuring (crypto or FX/rates/equities) with direct P&amp;amp;L responsibility and a proven track record of independently sourcing and closing high-profile clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the UAE, MENA and European crypto regulatory and market environment, with demonstrated experience defining and executing multi-year regional growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable expertise in perpetual futures, futures, and options, with existing relationships across Prosumer/Advanced retail clients in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with active and prosumer traders (e.g., high-value retail, professional day traders, social/desktop trading communities), ideally on derivatives platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly within the UAE, MENA and European region for client meetings, events, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
