&lt;li&gt;Build candidate pipelines through self-sourcing and competitive research, ensuring sufficient depth and quality at each stage to maintain hiring velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers across your client groups to translate hiring needs into effective search strategies and a strong candidate and interviewer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data integrity and use pipeline analytics to inform hiring efficiency, surface bottlenecks, and improve outcomes for your hiring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to recruiting process improvements and pilot programs that help the team scale its impact across global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-lifecycle recruiting experience in a technology company or similarly fast-paced, high-growth environment, with demonstrated success closing competitive candidates across G&amp;amp;A and/or technical functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to ramp quickly on new role types and talent markets, with the flexibility to shift between business and technical requisitions as priorities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
