&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As an L1 Social Support Specialist on the Customer Experience team, you&#39;ll serve as the frontline voice of Coinbase across our core social platforms. This role owns high-volume, real-time customer engagement via X (Twitter), Instagram, and Facebook, ensuring every customer feels heard while maintaining brand safety through moderated public responses. You&#39;ll operate on a 24/7 rolling roster, handling DMs independently and routing public replies through Shift Monitor approval to protect brand integrity at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end resolution of inbound DMs across X, Instagram, and Facebook, including authentication, troubleshooting, and routing into internal workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and submit public-facing replies and mentions for Shift Monitor approval, maintaining a consistent, platform-appropriate brand voice in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve customer issues by identifying root causes, tracking cases accurately, and escalating PR-sensitive concerns per established playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate customers on Coinbase products, features, and crypto best practices, guiding them to unlock services that match their unique profile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage inbound social volume by risk and visibility using dashboards and SLAs, prioritizing work to meet response time targets across all channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in public social support, community management, or social CX in a regulated or high-visibility industry (fintech, financial services, crypto).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to handle customers across DMs, public replies, and mentions with proven high-judgment, concise written communication adapted for short-form social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience triaging social volume by risk and visibility, moving conversations to DM when needed, and managing cases end-to-end within SLA-driven workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency with social engagement platforms (e.g., Sprinklr), ticketing systems (e.g., Salesforce Service Cloud, JIRA), and LLM/AI-powered support tools (copilots, chatbots, workflow automation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cryptocurrency concepts and willingness to develop deep product knowledge in a fast-changing regulatory and market environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
