&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Customer Experience and Engagement product team as its founding design hire, owning end-to-end design across Coinbase&#39;s AI-first customer support platform. The team builds the Help Center, Chatbot, Voicebot, and the premium Concierge support experience embedded inside the Coinbase app, with a mission to automate 90%+ of customer interactions by EOY 2026 while delivering the highest-quality support experience in fintech. You&#39;ll define the design vision across this full product surface and shape how millions of customers get help, driving measurable impact on automation quality, customer satisfaction, and Concierge revenue.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end design vision and execution across the full CX product surface, spanning Help Center, Chatbot, Voicebot, and the in-app Concierge support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive MVP and future-state concepts across the AI-powered support ecosystem, including self-service flows, conversational interactions, escalation paths, and proactive outreach surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design for Concierge, Coinbase&#39;s premium support product, translating a $50M+ revenue goal into a high-touch, differentiated in-app experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, and CX Operations to ground design decisions in real support data, automation performance metrics, and customer satisfaction signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape a reusable design system pattern library for AI-powered support, collaborating with the Coinbase Design System team to ensure consistency across Help Center, Chatbot, and Voicebot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build direct relationships with customers and support agents to generate insights that influence how Coinbase delivers world-class support at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills &amp;amp; experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Design experience with meaningful work on support, service, conversational UI, or AI-powered interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping end-to-end product design across both customer-facing and operator-facing (agent/internal tooling) surfaces within cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work autonomously across a complex, multi-surface product ecosystem, from early concept through production launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of visual design, interaction design, and conversation flow design, with fluency in Figma and modern prototyping tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication and stakeholder management across engineering, product, operations, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
