&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;The Strategic Pursuits team is a new group within Stripe’s Enterprise Platform Sales&amp;nbsp;organization, built to win Stripe’s most complex and high-impact opportunities. This team focuses&amp;nbsp;on multi-year, transformative sales cycles with the world’s largest software platforms and&amp;nbsp;enterprises—companies that have the potential to fundamentally shift Stripe’s presence in new&amp;nbsp;industries and markets.&amp;nbsp;Strategic Pursuits is responsible for identifying, shaping, and closing Stripe’s most significant&amp;nbsp;platform partnerships. These are long, intricate engagements requiring deep collaboration across&amp;nbsp;executive, product, and engineering teams and the ability to influence strategic priorities on both&amp;nbsp;sides of the table. The team’s work often extends well beyond payments, helping partners&amp;nbsp;co-develop entirely new business models and revenue streams powered by Stripe’s financial&amp;nbsp;infrastructure stack, including Connect, Billing, Payments, and Banking as a Service.&lt;/p&gt;
