&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You are a seasoned enterprise seller and strategic operator who thrives in high-stakes,&amp;nbsp;ambiguous environments. You are comfortable leading large, cross-functional pursuits that&amp;nbsp;require creativity, patience, and precision. You combine deep financial and technical&amp;nbsp;understanding with exceptional executive presence and storytelling. You’re equally adept at&amp;nbsp;designing commercial frameworks, navigating complex organizational dynamics, and inspiring&amp;nbsp;teams toward shared outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
