&lt;p&gt;Team Matching: exact team matching for one of the subteams will begin during final stages. Please note we may also consider you for different orgs based on your experience, location, etc. More information on our team matching process can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zvJkO2c7GzukHG-_oqc5wbOLajpuh5FjbmZPcZPU1o0/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.ahb3b6nrktv1&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Full-Stack Engineer on the Enterprise and Ecosystem team, you will be a key contributor in building and scaling the next generation of Stripe&#39;s connectivity with global commerce systems. This role is crucial to building and managing integrations with leading Ecommerce, CRM, and ERP systems to help our users activate faster and realize greater value from Stripe. You will focus on developing the infrastructure that powers unified connectors for various partners, ensuring seamless and rapid integration of Stripe&#39;s products.&lt;/p&gt;
