&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with other engineering teams, particularly those focused on underlying infrastructure, to ensure cohesion and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
