&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–10+ years of industry software engineering experience (does not include internships or co-ops)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding skills in any programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work across workstreams within your team and contribute to your peers&#39; success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive with a high level of autonomy and responsibility and an entrepreneurial mindset&lt;/li&gt;
