&lt;li&gt;Oversee the preparation and submission of comprehensive regulatory and financial reporting deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead financial statement preparation, audit support, and technical documentation, including presentations to the Board of Directors&lt;/li&gt;
