&lt;p&gt;The Financial Crimes team plays a critical role in ensuring a healthy financial ecosystem and maintaining trust in Stripe&#39;s platform. We ensure that prohibited parties cannot utilize our services and identify bad actors engaging in money laundering, terrorist financing, or other financial crimes. As Stripe&#39;s user base and global footprint grows dramatically, this team is essential for mitigating risk and upholding regulatory compliance, directly contributing to Stripe&#39;s mission of increasing the GDP of the internet safely and responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
