&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of relevant design experience at a product-driven tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong craft demonstrated through a portfolio of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated skills in prototyping at high fidelity using the latest AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills through design deliverables, videos, and written artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
