&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain sales and marketing assets (case studies, solution pages, pitch decks, one-pagers, enablement and trainings) that drive pipeline conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between Bridge and Stripe product marketing to bring connectivity across the marketing strategy for both parts of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex into other Bridge marketing needs as they arise, supporting the broader team during peak moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
