&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s Global Product Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team is a small, high impact team. We help run the Global product organization, which is responsible for helping Stripe and our users expand globally. Our team works cross functionally within the Global Product and across most of Stripe’s teams. We develop the long-term strategic plan for Global, drive an operating model that allows the Global organization to operate at scale, and design and incubate high impact 0→1 initiatives. Whatever it is, we work on what will move the needle most for Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
