&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in risk management, compliance, or operations in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling operational processes and driving quantifiable improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally on complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use data to quantify problems, tell a story, and influence a solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability and desire to challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinker who considers problems from a customer perspective while being pragmatic and solutions-oriented when solving them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing feedback patterns and using those insights to drive process and tooling improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a lot of ownership, are accountable, and drive towards ambitious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep empathy for entrepreneurs running a business and motivation to solve problems to empower them&lt;/li&gt;
