&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating cross-functional work across teams with different priorities and areas of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying process gaps and improving standard operating procedures, policies, or operational tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
